sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as GlobalExceptionHandler
    participant T as TraceContext (ThreadLocal)
    participant S as Services / Repos / Locks
    C->>H: create booking
    H->>T: start() → "3f9a1c2b"
    H->>H: DEBUG --> POST /api/v1/bookings
    H->>S: business logic
    S->>S: every log line reads TraceContext.current()
    S-->>H: result / exception
    H->>H: INFO/WARN <-- POST /api/v1/bookings 201 (1 ms)
    H->>T: clear()  (thread is reused)
    H-->>C: ApiResponse{..., traceId:"3f9a1c2b"}
